cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >
  If you use this software in your research, please cite it using the metadata below.
title: "AMOC-Kipppunkt: interactive UTAC-logistic sandbox for amoc-utac (P18)"
abstract: >
  Interactive companion to GenesisAeon Package 18 (amoc-utac). Ports the
  calibrated UTAC-logistic ODE (H_star = K*tanh(sigma*Gamma), dH/dt =
  r*H*(H_star/K - H/K)) and the CREP Gamma composition (0.30 C + 0.35 R +
  0.20 E + 0.15*(1-P)) directly from the package's constants.py and
  crep_amoc.py. Displays the corrected Ditlevsen et al. tipping-year
  estimate and the IPCC AR6 consensus position alongside the live
  simulation, both explicitly labelled as context rather than the
  sandbox's own output.
version: "0.2.0"
date-released: "2026-09-03"
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/GenesisAeon/amoc-kipppunkt"
